# Check text files out with LF on every platform. The frozen survey word list and split are
# verified by SHA-256 (tests/test_freeze.py), and a CRLF checkout (the Windows default on
# CI) changes the bytes and therefore the hash. Shell scripts also break with CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.tsv text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
.githooks/* text eol=lf

# Binary files: never convert.
*.xlsx binary
